<title>USA: UAL's United Air January load factor up.</title>
<headline>UAL's United Air January load factor up.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Airlines, a unit of UAL Corp, said on Wednesday its January passenger load factor increased 0.5 point to 67 percent from 66.5 percent a year ago.</p>
<p>It said total revenue passenger miles gained 7.6 percent to 9.16 billion from 8.51 billion, and available seat miles rose 6.8 percent to 13.68 billion from 12.81 billion.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
